:: S: Lab 1 (unavailable) [storylet]
{=

(storylet: when
$place's sublocation is "Apesai Lighthouse"
and $char's player's att does not contain "accessLighthouseStudentLab"
)

(urgency: 1)

(metadata:
"title", "Wander Into the Tower",
"cardDesc", "Perhaps the davehmars will welcome one of its own and let you use their facilities?",
"img", "https://fallenlondon.wiki/w/images/8/83/University.png",
)

$cssColumnParent[

$cssColumnChild[
	$cssBox[
    	($funcImage: (passage:)'s img)
         $cssBoxItem[''(print: (passage:)'s title )''<br>(print: (passage:)'s cardDesc)]
    ]
]

$cssColumnChild[

Entering into the lighthouse's grounds, you dodge the children playing chase, sidestep more than a few mysterious spills, and enter the Apesai school's main hall.
<br>
Perhaps "school" is a bit generous. It certainly was not built to be one, judging by how cramped everything is on the inside. The place looks more like the private research tower of some ancient magus, who only meant to house themself and maybe a dozen more of their retinue.
<br>
On the other hand, you're losing count of how many apprentices there are here.
<br>
Still, their presence implies that there are also adult davehmars, magical equipment, and anything that a traveling magus like yourself may need.
<br>
Someone ought to be able to show you around properly.
<br>
---

